 Hour&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-medusa" data-if="title == &#x27;Medusa Boss&#x27; || title == &#x27;Medusa&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-gaion" data-if="title == &#x27;Gaion Boss&#x27; || title == &#x27;Gaion&#x27; || title == &#x27;Gaion the Gladiator&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-fortune" data-if="title == &#x27;Box Of Fortune&#x27; || title == &#x27;Box of Fortune&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-mini-1" data-if="title == &#x27;Mini Invasion1&#x27; || title == &#x27;Mini Invasion 1&#x27; || title == &#x27;Mini Invasion I&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-mini-2" data-if="title == &#x27;Mini Invasion2&#x27; || title == &#x27;Mini Invasion 2&#x27; || title == &#x27;Mini Invasion II&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-mini-3" data-if="title == &#x27;Mini Invasion3&#x27; || title == &#x27;Mini Invasion 3&#x27; || title == &#x27;Mini Invasion III&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-mini-4" data-if="title == &#x27;Mini Invasion4&#x27; || title == &#x27;Mini Invasion 4&#x27; || title == &#x27;Mini Invasion IV&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-mini-5" data-if="title == &#x27;Mini Invasion5&#x27; || title == &#x27;Mini Invasion 5&#x27; || title == &#x27;Mini Invasion V&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-kardamahal" data-if="title == &#x27;Kardamahal&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-kanturu" data-if="title == &#x27;Kanturu&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-crywolf" data-if="title == &#x27;Curse of Crywolf&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-karutan" data-if="title == &#x27;Karutan Underground&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-generals" data-if="title == &#x27;Guerra de Generales&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-race" data-if="title == &#x27;Carrera de Caballos&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-fugitive" data-if="title == &#x27;Fugitivo de París&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-tower" data-if="title == &#x27;Torre Eiffel&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-tvt" data-if="title == &#x27;TvT Event&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-guild-battle" data-if="title == &#x27;Guild Battle&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-king" data-if="title == &#x27;King of MU&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-sky" data-if="title == &#x27;Sky Event&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-arena-0" data-if="title == &#x27;SOY LEYENDA&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-arena-1" data-if="title == &#x27;MGxMG&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-arena-2" data-if="title == &#x27;SMxSM&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-arena-3" data-if="title == &#x27;BMxBM&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-arena-5" data-if="title == &#x27;DLxDL&#x27;"></div><div class="guide-landscape art-arena-6" data-if="title == &#x27;ELFxELF&#x27;"></div><img id="guide-boss-model" data-if="boss != 'PARIS PROJECT'"/><div class="guide-boss-caption">{{boss}}</div></div>
   <div class="guide-metrics"><div><i class="metric-ticket"></i><span>ENTRADAS</span><strong>{{entries}}</strong></div><div><i class="metric-players"></i><span>JUGADORES</span><strong>{{players}}</strong></div><div><i class="metric-clock"></i><span>TIEMPO RESTANTE</span><strong>{{countdown}}</strong></div></div>
   <div class="guide-info">
    <div class="guide-requirements"><div class="guide-ornament"><i class="edge-tl"></i><i class="edge-t"></i><i class="edge-tr"></i><i class="edge-l"></i><i class="edge-r"></i><i class="edge-bl"></i><i class="edge-b"></i><i class="edge-br"></i></div><h3>REQUISITOS DE ACCESO</h3><div class="guide-scroll" data-class-compact="requirement_split &gt; 3"><div class="guide-requirement-column left"><div data-for="row, i : requirements" data-if="i &lt; requirement_split" class="guide-requirement"><span>{{row.name}}</span><strong data-class-live="row.state == 1" data-class-unmet="row.state == 0">{{row.value}}</strong></div></div><div class="guide-requirement-column right"><div data-for="row, i : requirements" data-if="i >= requirement_split" class="guide-requirement"><span>{{row.name}}</span><strong data-class-live="row.state == 1" data-class-unmet="row.state == 0">{{row.value}}</strong></div></div></div></div>
